<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0E1420', position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 40, width: 3, height: 44, background: '#C8A15A' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 92, top: 36, width: 900 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>覆盖到什么程度就够了：一条成本交叉曲线</Text></Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 72, top: 46 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.45)' }}>02 · 三级验收</Text></Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 132, width: 700, height: 404 }}>
        <Chart
            style={{ width: 700, height: 404 }}
            chartType='lineChart'
            grouping='standard'
            showLegend={true}
            showDataLabels={false}
            legendColor='#8A99AC'
            axisColor='#8A99AC'
            colors={['#C8A15A', '#7C8B9E']}
            background='#0E1420'
            data={[
                ['覆盖率 %', '逃逸成本', '验证成本'],
                [40, 100, 2],
                [50, 64, 3],
                [60, 41, 5],
                [70, 26, 9],
                [80, 16, 15],
                [90, 10, 26],
                [100, 7, 45],
            ]}
        />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 552, width: 700, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 1, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.6)' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, lineHeight: 1.6, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.35)' }}>横轴覆盖率；纵轴相对成本指数。两条曲线均为分析模型示意，非实测数据。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 806, top: 138, width: 402, height: 492, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#C8A15A' }}>判断</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 1, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.45)', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 20 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>不必追 100%，<br />但要主动抬高目标。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12, marginTop: 26 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.75)', width: 16 }}>01</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.8, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)', width: 348 }}>交叉点约在 81%。再往上加覆盖，验证成本涨得比逃逸损失降得快。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12, marginTop: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.75)', width: 16 }}>02</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.8, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)', width: 348 }}>这个点会移动。量产爬坡期缺陷率上升，整条逃逸曲线右移，交叉点随之抬高。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12, marginTop: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.75)', width: 16 }}>03</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.8, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)', width: 348 }}>覆盖目标是随阶段变化的变量，不是一次谈定的常数。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.09)', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 14, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#C8A15A' }}>对评审的含义</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.75, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>要求团队报出「当前阶段的目标覆盖率」及其依据，而不是一个不带阶段的完成度。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 660, width: 1136, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.10)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 678 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.35)' }}>可制造性评估维度解析</Text></Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 72, top: 678 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.45)' }}>09 / 16</Text></Box>

</Slide>
